  "abstract": "This submission is a re-run of Aether I's ablation model \"Gradient Clipping ONLY\" (ID 271, score -0.026683), which applies global gradient clipping (norm=1.0) but retains the simpler, single-layer MLP in the factor space. The primary objective is to export the total L2 norm of the model's parameters using the `complete()` hook. This data will be used in a comparative analytical study (across different ablation models) to investigate the synergistic effect of network depth and gradient clipping on training dynamics, addressing reviewer feedback for Archive #6.",
